WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:30.296
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

3
01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

4
01:35.260 --> 01:38.940
=Episode 33=

5
01:40.340 --> 01:40.660
Give it to me!

6
01:40.700 --> 01:41.340
It's mine!

7
01:44.100 --> 01:44.740
Hand it over!

8
01:45.980 --> 01:46.460
Give it back!

9
01:46.460 --> 01:47.460
Please, give me something to eat!

10
01:50.420 --> 01:51.100
Just a bite, please!

11
01:51.100 --> 01:51.620
No!

12
01:56.980 --> 01:57.660
Lost again?

13
01:57.900 --> 01:59.340
Go home and beat your old man again.

14
01:59.420 --> 02:01.220
Maybe he's still hiding some burial money!

15
02:09.020 --> 02:09.700
Hurry up!

16
02:10.020 --> 02:12.020
They're waiting to buy your wife's body for burial.

17
02:12.420 --> 02:13.180
Miss the auspicious hour,

18
02:13.260 --> 02:14.260
and you won't even get this much!

19
02:16.980 --> 02:19.540
Selling his own wife's corpse...

20
02:20.740 --> 02:22.260
What a terrible thing!

21
02:23.780 --> 02:24.580
Three years.

22
02:27.260 --> 02:28.060
What did you say, sir?

23
02:31.460 --> 02:33.020
County magistrates are reassigned every three years.

24
02:33.780 --> 02:34.300
By then,

25
02:35.180 --> 02:36.460
I may no longer be in Lanyang.

26
02:40.700 --> 02:42.060
Just bear with it, sir.

27
02:42.740 --> 02:44.700
Then you can move somewhere better.

28
02:45.540 --> 02:45.940
No.

29
02:47.220 --> 02:48.260
Three years from now,

30
02:49.340 --> 02:49.860
Lanyang

31
02:50.900 --> 02:52.100
must not still look like this.

32
02:53.820 --> 02:54.260
Mr. Han,

33
02:55.540 --> 02:55.940
let's go.

34
02:58.940 --> 02:59.620
I won't go!

35
02:59.620 --> 03:00.020
Move!

36
03:00.380 --> 03:01.580
- How am I supposed to feed you? - I won't go!

37
03:01.820 --> 03:02.060
Go!

38
03:02.060 --> 03:03.340
Father, I don't want to go!

39
03:03.700 --> 03:04.540
- Behave yourself! - Eighty coins.

40
03:04.660 --> 03:06.100
- I won't go! - We agreed that settles the debt.

41
03:07.220 --> 03:08.260
Your father owes me a fortune in rent!

42
03:08.260 --> 03:08.540
No!

43
03:08.540 --> 03:08.900
Keep screaming,

44
03:09.340 --> 03:10.340
and I'll cook you in a pot!

45
03:10.540 --> 03:11.460
I won't go!

46
03:11.860 --> 03:12.460
I won't go!

47
03:12.620 --> 03:13.020
I won't!

48
03:13.060 --> 03:13.860
Get lost!

49
03:15.220 --> 03:15.780
Father!

50
03:16.180 --> 03:16.820
Father!

51
03:18.500 --> 03:19.140
Father!

52
03:34.420 --> 03:35.060
Slow down.

53
03:35.500 --> 03:36.020
Eat slowly.

54
03:37.860 --> 03:42.740
(Donglang)

55
03:47.700 --> 03:48.260
(Shendu Hall) Sir,

56
03:48.780 --> 03:50.900
can you really not see anything at all?

57
03:55.300 --> 03:55.740
Donglang,

58
03:57.220 --> 03:58.460
would you be willing to be my eyes?

59
03:58.980 --> 03:59.620
How?

60
04:00.780 --> 04:01.420
Can you read?

61
04:02.220 --> 04:03.380
I've never been that lucky.

62
04:03.700 --> 04:05.540
Only a handful of families

63
04:05.660 --> 04:06.620
in Lanyang can read.

64
04:07.220 --> 04:08.980
Poor people stay poor forever.

65
04:10.340 --> 04:11.820
Reading won't change anything.

66
04:14.140 --> 04:14.900
That's not true.

67
04:15.980 --> 04:16.700
I can read,

68
04:17.460 --> 04:18.500
and that's how I was able to save you.

69
04:26.060 --> 04:27.180
Reading can save lives.

70
04:29.420 --> 04:30.580
It can save many lives.

71
04:36.420 --> 04:37.140
Then...

72
04:38.220 --> 04:39.260
could you teach me?

73
04:48.500 --> 04:49.220
Yang Si, you convicted criminal!

74
04:49.780 --> 04:50.300
Stop that!

75
04:50.940 --> 04:51.300
Come out!

76
05:12.220 --> 05:13.460
You're the one who ordered my release?

77
05:21.420 --> 05:21.980
Yang Si,

78
05:22.860 --> 05:23.540
it's good to see you again.

79
05:24.460 --> 05:24.980
What happened

80
05:25.700 --> 05:26.140
to His Majesty?

81
05:26.660 --> 05:27.860
His Majesty is unwell.

82
05:28.860 --> 05:29.700
He's suspended court to recuperate.

83
05:31.420 --> 05:32.900
I don't know how you managed it, Wanyao,

84
05:33.460 --> 05:34.660
but could you...

85
05:34.740 --> 05:35.180
No.

86
05:42.220 --> 05:42.980
Whatever happened,

87
05:44.420 --> 05:46.260
I did save you and Yan Shang that day

88
05:47.020 --> 05:48.260
and bring you both safely back to Sheng'an,

89
05:48.940 --> 05:50.020
even though it led to the Crown Prince's downfall.

90
05:51.340 --> 05:52.540
For the sake of that favor,

91
05:52.700 --> 05:53.860
could you release him from prison?

92
05:54.100 --> 05:54.780
A favor?

93
05:57.780 --> 05:59.740
Did my brother ever show me any mercy?

94
06:01.820 --> 06:03.860
When he sent Yu Niang to kill us,

95
06:04.420 --> 06:05.620
he certainly showed none.

96
06:08.300 --> 06:08.940
Besides,

97
06:09.980 --> 06:11.580
he's the deposed Crown Prince now.

98
06:12.500 --> 06:14.060
Don't get his title wrong again.

99
06:17.740 --> 06:18.260
Yang Si.

100
06:19.020 --> 06:20.900
I haven't forgotten what you did for me that day.

101
06:21.780 --> 06:22.540
That's why

102
06:23.100 --> 06:23.980
I granted you a special pardon today.

103
06:24.780 --> 06:26.180
But apparently, that's not enough for you.

104
06:26.820 --> 06:27.860
You don't even seem grateful.

105
06:31.100 --> 06:31.540
Wanyao,

106
06:33.140 --> 06:34.220
I just want to ask you one thing.

107
06:36.180 --> 06:37.940
What are you going to do with Mu Xun?

108
06:39.700 --> 06:41.100
I'll have to give that some thought.

109
06:41.820 --> 06:42.420
Perhaps

110
06:43.020 --> 06:44.300
there's a precedent I could follow.

111
06:44.740 --> 06:46.260
You know full well that no deposed Crown Prince

112
06:46.260 --> 06:47.980
has ever survived more than six months in this dynasty!

113
07:10.060 --> 07:10.700
I'm begging you.

114
07:12.020 --> 07:12.740
I, Yang Si,

115
07:13.540 --> 07:14.140
am begging you.

116
07:15.420 --> 07:16.180
Please don't let him die.

117
07:18.140 --> 07:19.260
The price will be steep.

118
07:20.860 --> 07:21.580
What do you want?

119
07:22.700 --> 07:23.420
Just name it.

120
07:23.660 --> 07:24.420
Anything within my power.

121
07:29.340 --> 07:29.860
I want you

122
07:33.860 --> 07:35.900
to give me yourself in exchange.

123
07:38.980 --> 07:39.460
Wanyao,

124
07:40.980 --> 07:42.820
you want me to die in his place?

125
07:44.500 --> 07:45.620
What would I want your life for?

126
07:47.340 --> 07:48.300
I want your freedom.

127
07:48.740 --> 07:50.620
Marry me and become my prince consort, Yang Si.

128
07:54.580 --> 07:55.340
I don't understand.

129
07:55.540 --> 07:57.460
Why would you make a joke of your own marriage?

130
07:58.820 --> 08:01.260
My marriage has always been a joke.

131
08:02.140 --> 08:03.020
But now,

132
08:03.780 --> 08:05.580
I'm no longer that frightened girl

133
08:05.900 --> 08:08.180
who lets imperial decrees decide her fate.

134
08:09.580 --> 08:10.300
This time,

135
08:11.340 --> 08:13.180
I'll be the one telling the joke.

136
08:19.700 --> 08:22.020
What you really want is someone to fill the role of prince consort.

137
08:22.300 --> 08:22.940
Exactly.

138
08:23.740 --> 08:25.340
As long as my marriage remains undecided,

139
08:26.180 --> 08:26.980
the officials at court

140
08:27.260 --> 08:28.540
will keep arguing over it.

141
08:29.660 --> 08:30.500
My marriage

142
08:31.100 --> 08:32.620
will always be an excuse to stir up trouble.

143
08:33.580 --> 08:34.580
I'm sick of it.

144
08:35.220 --> 08:36.380
I never want to hear them

145
08:36.380 --> 08:37.940
buzzing around like flies,

146
08:38.300 --> 08:39.180
using it to cause trouble again.

147
08:40.540 --> 08:43.260
So I'll have to put an end to it myself.

148
08:46.140 --> 08:46.860
Why me?

149
08:55.260 --> 08:56.500
Because I need someone

150
08:57.020 --> 08:59.260
from a noble family whom the court can't object to.

151
09:01.340 --> 09:03.780
Someone I know inside and out.

152
09:05.260 --> 09:06.580
Someone who'll do as he's told.

153
09:09.700 --> 09:10.300
Yang Si,

154
09:11.780 --> 09:12.900
will you be that man?

155
09:22.300 --> 09:22.980
(Stop running!)

156
09:25.620 --> 09:26.180
(Mu Wanyao,)

157
09:26.700 --> 09:27.780
(you're playing the bride.)

158
09:28.580 --> 09:30.220
(How can a bride not have a flower in her hair?)

159
09:30.700 --> 09:31.020
(Here.)

160
09:34.700 --> 09:35.300
(How pretty!)

161
09:46.420 --> 09:46.900
All right.

162
09:50.220 --> 09:50.940
I agree.

163
09:53.900 --> 09:54.460
Yang Si,

164
09:57.540 --> 09:59.260
do you know what makes

165
10:01.100 --> 10:02.060
a suitable prince consort?

166
10:03.300 --> 10:03.780
Harmless.

167
10:06.140 --> 10:06.740
Inactive.

168
10:08.420 --> 10:09.020
And powerless.

169
10:16.980 --> 10:17.700
And I promise you

170
10:19.220 --> 10:20.180
I'll keep Mu Xun alive.

171
10:23.540 --> 10:24.660
(As long as it's not him,)

172
10:26.900 --> 10:28.020
(anyone else will do.)

173
10:29.140 --> 10:29.740
(Right?)

174
11:07.820 --> 11:08.780
What time is it?

175
11:09.740 --> 11:10.260
Your Highness,

176
11:10.860 --> 11:11.860
it's near the hour of Xu.

177
11:12.940 --> 11:13.940
You should get some rest.

178
11:14.580 --> 11:16.060
Come and dress me in the third quarter of the Mao hour.

179
11:16.500 --> 11:18.220
I must meet several ministers early tomorrow morning.

180
11:18.500 --> 11:19.700
You're not going to sleep again?

181
11:39.660 --> 11:40.140
Minister Wang,

182
11:40.620 --> 11:41.900
do you have any idea

183
11:41.900 --> 11:42.860
what the people of Huai are going through?

184
11:42.860 --> 11:44.540
We have hundreds of thousands of troops on the frontier!

185
11:44.660 --> 11:46.660
Without their pay, morale will collapse!

186
11:46.660 --> 11:48.340
(Wang Cong, Minister of War) How are they supposed to fight?

187
11:49.180 --> 11:50.780
(Jiang Hua, Minister of Revenue) Empty or not, we must find a way.

188
11:50.860 --> 11:51.660
Your Highness,

189
11:51.940 --> 11:53.820
(Universe in Harmony) years of unrest caused

190
11:54.100 --> 11:56.300
by military governors and Yu's faction have pushed the people to their limits.

191
11:56.780 --> 11:58.900
If we raise taxes again to fund the army,

192
11:59.220 --> 12:00.580
we risk a popular uprising!

193
12:00.860 --> 12:01.580
Without raising taxes,

194
12:02.540 --> 12:04.740
where will next year's military funds come from?

195
12:05.140 --> 12:06.020
Raise taxes?

196
12:07.580 --> 12:08.740
Who said anything about raising taxes?

197
12:09.820 --> 12:10.820
Excessive taxation

198
12:11.580 --> 12:12.580
only breeds resentment.

199
12:13.260 --> 12:14.260
That's no way to govern.

200
12:16.060 --> 12:17.100
I have a proposal

201
12:17.460 --> 12:18.380
that could solve this problem.

202
12:20.020 --> 12:20.940
Let the army farm its own food.

203
12:22.180 --> 12:22.780
Gentlemen,

204
12:23.340 --> 12:24.140
what do you think?

205
12:25.220 --> 12:25.780
Your Highness,

206
12:26.700 --> 12:29.860
where could we find enough unused land for the troops to farm?

207
12:31.140 --> 12:31.580
Exactly!

208
12:31.820 --> 12:32.260
That's right!

209
12:33.020 --> 12:34.620
(Universe in Harmony)

210
12:34.620 --> 12:35.340
Right!

211
12:40.220 --> 12:41.060
The estates confiscated from officials

212
12:41.580 --> 12:43.900
implicated in the former Crown Prince's case,

213
12:44.820 --> 12:45.780
and the lands seized around the capital

214
12:46.460 --> 12:48.620
by Yu Cheng'an over the years,

215
12:49.140 --> 12:50.340
I've ordered them all surveyed

216
12:51.060 --> 12:52.660
and allocated for military farming.

217
12:53.500 --> 12:55.020
That's 900,000 mu of fertile land.

218
12:55.660 --> 12:56.380
How can you say there's no land?

219
12:58.740 --> 12:59.820
Of everything the military farms produce,

220
13:00.380 --> 13:02.140
ten percent will go to the treasury

221
13:02.780 --> 13:04.540
to fund weapons, bows, and horses.

222
13:05.340 --> 13:05.900
Another ten percent

223
13:06.420 --> 13:08.340
will improve the soldiers' food and clothing.

224
13:09.020 --> 13:09.620
And ten percent

225
13:10.420 --> 13:12.220
will go to the families of the farming soldiers.

226
13:13.460 --> 13:15.020
I want these soldiers

227
13:15.420 --> 13:16.980
to be well fed and warmly clothed,

228
13:17.660 --> 13:18.540
with enough food for their families,

229
13:18.940 --> 13:20.060
so they know who they're fighting for.

230
13:24.020 --> 13:25.020
Your Highness, this plan

231
13:25.420 --> 13:26.540
will benefit both the throne and the nation.

232
13:26.860 --> 13:28.100
It's an excellent proposal!

233
13:28.500 --> 13:29.300
I haven't finished.

234
13:31.740 --> 13:32.220
Wang Cong.

235
13:33.460 --> 13:34.060
Yes, Your Highness?

236
13:34.540 --> 13:35.340
As Minister of War,

237
13:35.980 --> 13:37.580
you'll oversee this plan.

238
13:38.660 --> 13:39.900
The Censorate and Jinwu Guards

239
13:40.460 --> 13:41.380
will assist with supervision.

240
13:42.300 --> 13:43.220
If anything goes wrong,

241
13:44.020 --> 13:44.860
you'll answer for it.

242
13:45.300 --> 13:47.260
I'll do everything in my power

243
13:47.420 --> 13:48.620
to live up to Your Highness's trust!

244
13:49.180 --> 13:51.460
We won't let Your Highness down!

245
14:22.020 --> 14:22.700
What are you doing here?

246
14:22.980 --> 14:23.780
There are two things

247
14:24.180 --> 14:26.060
I'd like to present to Your Highness personally.

248
14:31.180 --> 14:32.860
His Majesty was kind enough to entrust me

249
14:33.580 --> 14:35.140
with the Shence Army's command tally.

250
14:35.820 --> 14:37.060
I've always felt unworthy of the honor.

251
14:37.460 --> 14:39.380
Now that Your Highness

252
14:39.660 --> 14:40.540
governs under Heaven's mandate,

253
14:41.780 --> 14:44.300
I humbly ask Your Highness to take back this tally

254
14:44.620 --> 14:45.540
to ensure the army's loyalty.

255
14:48.260 --> 14:49.220
(Shence Army)

256
14:52.380 --> 14:53.180
With your abilities,

257
14:53.860 --> 14:55.180
you could have a dozen of these

258
14:55.620 --> 14:56.820
and still couldn't command the Shence Army.

259
14:58.180 --> 14:59.460
Father knew that perfectly well.

260
15:00.460 --> 15:01.700
That's why he gave it to you.

261
15:04.980 --> 15:06.700
Your Highness is absolutely right.

262
15:07.580 --> 15:07.900
Your Highness,

263
15:08.420 --> 15:09.140
there's also this.

264
15:11.940 --> 15:12.700
And what's this?

265
15:13.380 --> 15:14.340
When I worked in the Imperial Cuisine Service,

266
15:14.980 --> 15:17.020
I heard you were fond of chilled lychee wine.

267
15:17.740 --> 15:18.780
It's hard to find in Sheng'an,

268
15:19.220 --> 15:21.020
so I brought some especially for you.

269
15:30.460 --> 15:30.980
Come to think of it,

270
15:31.500 --> 15:33.820
if not for your help and Yan Shang's,

271
15:34.140 --> 15:36.620
I'd never have entered the palace and built a career.

272
15:37.100 --> 15:39.340
I might have died somewhere long ago.

273
15:42.740 --> 15:44.100
When I first joined the Imperial Cuisine Service,

274
15:44.460 --> 15:46.780
I carried this food box every day.

275
15:47.380 --> 15:49.580
I keep it in my office now

276
15:49.980 --> 15:51.260
to remind myself where I came from,

277
15:51.620 --> 15:51.980
and never forget

278
15:52.500 --> 15:53.220
the kindness I received.

279
15:56.820 --> 15:57.780
How thoughtful of you.

280
15:59.540 --> 16:00.700
But it sounds to me

281
16:01.500 --> 16:02.660
like you have more to say.

282
16:07.380 --> 16:08.740
Ever since I entered the palace,

283
16:09.180 --> 16:10.580
I've never had the chance to serve Your Highness directly.

284
16:10.820 --> 16:11.860
I deeply regret that.

285
16:12.500 --> 16:12.940
However,

286
16:13.580 --> 16:15.140
through all the recent turmoil,

287
16:15.460 --> 16:16.940
I've done what little I could.

288
16:17.540 --> 16:18.060
I'm sure

289
16:18.820 --> 16:20.140
Your Highness is already aware of that.

290
16:21.300 --> 16:22.220
So I humbly ask

291
16:22.420 --> 16:23.460
for Your Highness's favor.

292
16:23.780 --> 16:25.940
Please allow me to serve you personally

293
16:26.100 --> 16:26.900
and repay even a fraction of your kindness.

294
16:30.340 --> 16:31.140
As it happens,

295
16:31.900 --> 16:33.180
I do have something for you to do.

296
16:37.580 --> 16:38.420
Now that you've been relieved

297
16:38.420 --> 16:39.820
of your duties with the Shence Army,

298
16:40.860 --> 16:41.780
you can

299
16:42.260 --> 16:44.660
devote all your attention to the inner palace

300
16:45.580 --> 16:46.980
and take good care of His Majesty.

301
16:54.900 --> 16:55.260
As you command.

302
16:58.940 --> 16:59.900
I'm counting on you, Mr. Liu.

303
17:01.580 --> 17:02.940
Since you'll be caring for my father on my behalf,

304
17:03.780 --> 17:04.380
your monthly salary

305
17:05.020 --> 17:05.780
will naturally be doubled.

306
17:20.380 --> 17:20.900
Thank you, Your Highness.

307
17:37.380 --> 17:38.020
(Liu Wenji,)

308
17:39.020 --> 17:39.700
(I was willing)

309
17:39.700 --> 17:41.180
(to give you a chance to make something of yourself.)

310
17:42.460 --> 17:44.340
(But I fear even you haven't realized)

311
17:45.340 --> 17:46.220
(how much)

312
17:47.100 --> 17:47.980
(you've changed.)

313
18:18.220 --> 18:18.860
Mr. Liu.

314
18:21.700 --> 18:22.700
How is His Majesty?

315
18:24.780 --> 18:26.100
His Majesty is getting better.

316
18:26.660 --> 18:29.460
He's staying awake much longer than before.

317
18:29.820 --> 18:32.620
And we've finally managed to give him some medicine.

318
18:35.340 --> 18:36.420
You should get some rest.

319
18:37.100 --> 18:37.620
Thank you.

320
18:55.380 --> 18:56.540
Shou'en...

321
18:58.100 --> 18:58.740
Shou'en...

322
19:03.540 --> 19:04.140
My arm's numb.

323
19:05.940 --> 19:06.260
Your Majesty.

324
19:07.420 --> 19:08.220
Feeling better now?

325
19:15.140 --> 19:15.540
Your Majesty.

326
19:17.700 --> 19:18.540
It's you.

327
19:19.420 --> 19:20.060
Yes, Your Majesty.

328
19:21.460 --> 19:22.820
What are you doing here?

329
19:23.700 --> 19:24.020
Your Majesty,

330
19:24.940 --> 19:26.660
you gave me the chance to rise in the palace.

331
19:27.140 --> 19:28.300
I'll never forget your kindness.

332
19:28.940 --> 19:29.460
Now,

333
19:29.980 --> 19:31.260
I've volunteered to care for you.

334
19:31.620 --> 19:32.380
I only hope

335
19:33.300 --> 19:34.860
Your Majesty won't turn me away.

336
19:46.340 --> 19:47.020
Very good.

337
20:38.900 --> 20:39.940
The plum blossoms in Sheng'an

338
20:41.580 --> 20:42.860
have the same fragrance.

339
20:54.540 --> 20:56.700
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

340
20:56.700 --> 20:57.860
Your Highness! Your Highness!

341
20:57.860 --> 20:58.420
Please read my writings!

342
20:58.420 --> 20:58.860
Read mine!

343
20:58.860 --> 20:59.220
Stand back!

344
20:59.660 --> 21:00.300
Make way up front!

345
21:00.460 --> 21:00.780
Your Highness!

346
21:00.900 --> 21:01.340
Stand back!

347
21:01.660 --> 21:02.100
Get back!

348
21:02.540 --> 21:03.300
Please read my writings!

349
21:03.420 --> 21:03.780
Your Highness!

350
21:03.780 --> 21:04.420
Here's mine!

351
21:05.380 --> 21:06.020
And mine!

352
21:06.020 --> 21:06.500
Your Highness!

353
21:06.500 --> 21:07.180
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

354
21:07.340 --> 21:07.860
Stand back!

355
21:08.580 --> 21:09.100
Move aside!

356
21:09.100 --> 21:09.580
Here's mine!

357
21:09.580 --> 21:10.540
And mine!

358
21:10.540 --> 21:11.700
- Get out of my way! - I was here first!

359
21:11.700 --> 21:12.660
Your Highness! Your Highness!

360
21:12.660 --> 21:13.100
Stand back!

361
21:13.260 --> 21:13.900
Here's mine!

362
21:14.140 --> 21:14.700
Get back!

363
21:16.580 --> 21:17.380
Your Highness, just take a look!

364
21:17.460 --> 21:18.180
(My essays fall short,) Please read mine!

365
21:18.180 --> 21:18.780
(but follow Han Yu's ideals.) Get back!

366
21:18.780 --> 21:19.780
(Respectfully submitted by Wu Liu, a humble student from Lanyang.)

367
21:19.780 --> 21:20.660
Here's mine, Your Highness!

368
21:20.660 --> 21:21.580
These are my writings! Please take a look!

369
21:21.580 --> 21:22.220
Read mine first!

370
21:23.220 --> 21:24.020
Who's Wu Liu?

371
21:24.380 --> 21:25.860
Me! That's me, Your Highness!

372
21:26.820 --> 21:28.180
When did you leave your hometown?

373
21:29.020 --> 21:30.180
How are things there?

374
21:30.900 --> 21:31.460
I...

375
21:31.820 --> 21:33.260
I arrived in Sheng'an just three days ago.

376
21:33.540 --> 21:35.420
I never dreamed I'd be lucky enough to meet Your Highness.

377
21:35.860 --> 21:37.060
I'm from Lanyang,

378
21:37.660 --> 21:39.340
a poor, remote little place.

379
21:39.860 --> 21:41.820
What do people think of your new county magistrate?

380
21:42.340 --> 21:44.020
If our magistrate hadn't helped pay my way,

381
21:44.180 --> 21:45.380
I'd never have made it to Sheng'an.

382
21:46.300 --> 21:47.060
You know him?

383
21:47.740 --> 21:48.900
In our little town of Lanyang,

384
21:49.180 --> 21:50.100
every single person

385
21:50.260 --> 21:51.380
knows Magistrate Yan.

386
21:51.860 --> 21:54.060
Does Your Highness know Magistrate Yan too?

387
21:59.100 --> 22:00.820
Your Highness! Please take mine too!

388
22:08.340 --> 22:10.660
Maybe the princess really does know Magistrate Yan.

389
22:10.980 --> 22:12.900
I heard he placed third in the imperial examinations.

390
22:13.340 --> 22:14.780
Your Highness! Your Highness!

391
22:14.860 --> 22:16.060
A letter from Wei Shu.

392
22:16.820 --> 22:18.180
Dear Yan Shang,

393
22:18.860 --> 22:20.020
it's been years since we parted,

394
22:20.380 --> 22:21.740
and I miss you more with each passing day.

395
22:22.660 --> 22:24.980
I hear you've helped restore the throne,

396
22:25.220 --> 22:26.420
devoting all your strength to the cause.

397
22:27.540 --> 22:29.900
Your plans were loyal and fair.

398
22:30.540 --> 22:32.740
Your sincerity was selfless.

399
22:33.180 --> 22:34.540
Respectfully yours, Wei Shu.

400
22:37.580 --> 22:39.540
It's "Your counsel was loyal and sound,

401
22:40.140 --> 22:41.620
and your devotion truly selfless."

402
22:42.980 --> 22:43.420
Just one sentence.

403
22:43.940 --> 22:44.980
Count how many characters you got wrong.

404
22:45.500 --> 22:46.660
You've been so busy lately.

405
22:46.820 --> 22:48.180
You haven't taught me those characters yet.

406
22:48.580 --> 22:49.740
Of course I don't know them.

407
22:50.300 --> 22:52.460
Now the student is blaming his teacher?

408
22:54.940 --> 22:55.340
Well?

409
22:56.060 --> 22:56.500
Are you finished?

410
22:57.620 --> 22:58.540
There's another letter.

411
23:04.660 --> 23:06.060
Dear Yan Shang,

412
23:06.860 --> 23:08.780
though mountains and passes separate us,

413
23:09.380 --> 23:11.300
whenever I see the palace lychees ripening red

414
23:11.540 --> 23:12.580
or hear the roosters crow at dawn,

415
23:13.180 --> 23:16.020
I almost hear the woodcutters calling through Lingnan's hills.

416
23:17.180 --> 23:18.460
Respectfully yours, Liu Wenji.

417
23:19.180 --> 23:19.620
Sir,

418
23:20.060 --> 23:22.180
this one's from Liu Wenji in Sheng'an again.

419
23:23.660 --> 23:24.820
This month,

420
23:25.260 --> 23:28.020
Mr. Wei sent two letters.

421
23:29.740 --> 23:31.020
Mr. Liu

422
23:31.620 --> 23:32.300
sent five.

423
23:33.380 --> 23:35.060
Sir, are you still not going to reply?

424
23:38.020 --> 23:38.700
Why not?

425
23:39.140 --> 23:41.460
I may not understand everything,

426
23:42.020 --> 23:43.180
but I can tell

427
23:43.500 --> 23:45.540
they're both very dear friends of yours.

428
23:46.300 --> 23:48.340
They keep sending letters.

429
23:48.540 --> 23:50.220
They must really want to know how you're doing.

430
23:53.060 --> 23:54.140
They're both government officials,

431
23:54.580 --> 23:55.380
serving in the capital,

432
23:56.020 --> 23:57.140
where they're surrounded by informants.

433
23:58.420 --> 24:00.580
I was sent to a county post in disgrace.

434
24:01.140 --> 24:01.820
Given my situation,

435
24:02.540 --> 24:03.620
it's best I don't contact them.

436
24:06.860 --> 24:09.500
But if they never hear back from you,

437
24:09.820 --> 24:11.260
won't your friends be sad?

438
24:13.660 --> 24:14.660
If they didn't understand,

439
24:15.460 --> 24:17.140
why would they keep writing?

440
24:40.340 --> 24:45.260
♪Be the ferry where you wait for the sun♪

441
24:47.420 --> 24:52.660
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

442
24:54.900 --> 25:00.980
♪Be the sleeve we held, worn by dust and years♪

443
25:01.220 --> 25:06.740
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

444
25:06.740 --> 25:09.180
(Universe in Harmony)

445
25:09.180 --> 25:14.460
♪Let me be a captive beast bound by the same lock as you♪

446
25:14.620 --> 25:21.300
♪- Through trails of mud and blood; - Let grief drown in your eyes♪

447
25:22.740 --> 25:25.680
♪- Soar with the wind; - Plunge into hellfire as one♪

448
25:25.680 --> 25:27.580
♪Burning bright as a song♪

449
25:27.620 --> 25:31.220
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

450
25:31.340 --> 25:36.340
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪ (Charity School)

451
25:38.980 --> 25:39.340
Donglang,

452
25:40.460 --> 25:41.620
what do their faces look like?

453
25:41.620 --> 25:42.860
♪Not a single hour less♪

454
25:42.860 --> 25:44.340
Everyone's smiling from ear to ear!

455
25:44.940 --> 25:47.260
The children keep saying, "We can go to school now!"

456
25:47.460 --> 25:48.540
They're running around you.

457
25:51.060 --> 25:54.500
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

458
25:54.940 --> 25:57.620
In the past, candidates sought favor by presenting their writings.

459
25:58.460 --> 25:59.980
Scholars flocked to the homes of the powerful,

460
26:00.500 --> 26:02.220
and family connections often mattered more than merit.

461
26:03.220 --> 26:05.060
But thanks to Her Highness's wisdom and compassion,

462
26:05.500 --> 26:06.420
these long-standing abuses have been exposed.

463
26:06.780 --> 26:07.620
From now on,

464
26:08.100 --> 26:09.060
the imperial examinations

465
26:09.700 --> 26:10.500
will use anonymous, recopied scripts,

466
26:11.020 --> 26:13.380
so candidates will no longer depend on endorsements from the powerful.

467
26:14.580 --> 26:14.900
Sir,

468
26:15.500 --> 26:17.380
did I get everything right this time?

469
26:19.780 --> 26:21.540
♪- Be my one and only in this world; - Be my one and only in this life♪

470
26:21.540 --> 26:22.620
But...

471
26:23.100 --> 26:24.820
What exactly

472
26:25.580 --> 26:26.740
does Mr. Wei's letter mean?

473
26:26.780 --> 26:30.220
♪If only we could return to the village where we first met♪

474
26:30.500 --> 26:31.140
It means

475
26:31.940 --> 26:32.460
that someday,

476
26:33.060 --> 26:34.380
children like you

477
26:35.220 --> 26:36.940
will have more opportunities in life.

478
26:36.940 --> 26:41.000
♪Just us, through dawn and dusk♪

479
26:41.100 --> 26:42.980
♪- May time be free of fear; - Boats rock♪

480
26:42.980 --> 26:45.620
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn - May time be free of pain♪

481
26:45.780 --> 26:48.340
♪You're the only one I need♪

482
26:48.340 --> 26:52.020
♪By your side, through joy and pain, is that eternity?♪

483
26:52.020 --> 26:55.500
♪By your side, through joy and pain, is that eternity?♪

484
26:55.540 --> 26:58.940
♪- Till fireworks flood the town; - Till the lake is still and clear♪

485
26:58.980 --> 27:01.620
♪The wind blows past us♪

486
27:01.620 --> 27:03.262
(Three years later, 25th year of Yingxiang)

487
27:03.262 --> 27:05.020
(Severe drought, especially in Hannan Circuit)

488
27:05.140 --> 27:07.560
(The disaster is worse than ever. Please inform His Majesty at once.)

489
27:07.560 --> 27:10.090
(Release 300,000 shi of imperial grain. Order Jianghuai to send aid.)

490
27:10.090 --> 27:12.420
(Delay until late autumn risks unrest. Cui Mujin, Inspector of Monan Circuit.)

491
27:14.860 --> 27:19.060
(Universe in Harmony)

492
27:33.340 --> 27:34.340
Hot springs at Mount Li?

493
27:34.700 --> 27:35.020
Yes.

494
27:35.540 --> 27:36.500
(Wang Min, Palace's Deputy Director) As in previous years,

495
27:36.740 --> 27:39.100
we've prepared the plans for palace provisions, escorts, and carriages.

496
27:39.620 --> 27:40.980
We await Your Highness's approval.

497
27:44.580 --> 27:45.420
Do you have any idea what's happening?

498
27:46.260 --> 27:47.820
The people can't even find a mouthful of dirty water!

499
27:48.660 --> 27:51.180
And you want me to take the royal family to Mount Li?

500
27:52.220 --> 27:53.500
Bring me another proposal so out of touch

501
27:53.820 --> 27:55.260
and so indifferent to the people's suffering,

502
27:55.860 --> 27:57.140
and you'll lose your position in the Palace Administration!

503
27:57.820 --> 27:59.860
I happen to need someone to send to Hannan Circuit.

504
28:05.180 --> 28:05.500
Come back!

505
28:08.940 --> 28:10.700
Cut all palace expenses in half.

506
28:11.260 --> 28:11.780
Immediately have

507
28:12.300 --> 28:13.900
the Palace Administration draft a detailed plan

508
28:14.380 --> 28:14.980
and report back the day after tomorrow.

509
28:16.140 --> 28:16.540
And another thing.

510
28:17.140 --> 28:17.780
Effective immediately,

511
28:18.140 --> 28:19.380
cancel all banquets, entertainments, and hunting trips.

512
28:19.980 --> 28:21.220
Disaster relief and the people's welfare come first.

513
28:21.820 --> 28:22.140
Yes, Your Highness.

514
28:22.900 --> 28:23.300
Yes, Your Highness.

515
28:31.740 --> 28:34.660
(Universe in Harmony)

516
28:34.660 --> 28:35.620
Your Highness.

517
28:36.860 --> 28:39.020
The affected prefectures have followed your orders,

518
28:39.100 --> 28:40.900
opening granaries and distributing food and medicine,

519
28:41.180 --> 28:42.900
and severely punishing hoarders and profiteers.

520
28:44.300 --> 28:47.220
But with no rain, rivers and lakes have dried up.

521
28:47.500 --> 28:48.580
Relief aid alone

522
28:49.100 --> 28:50.420
won't sustain them much longer.

523
28:52.140 --> 28:53.100
Are you saying

524
28:54.380 --> 28:55.260
all we can do is wait for rain?

525
28:57.260 --> 28:59.380
There are limits to what we can do.

526
29:00.100 --> 29:01.940
To truly put an end to this disaster,

527
29:02.700 --> 29:03.580
we must wait for rain.

528
29:07.540 --> 29:09.660
(Any delay until late autumn may cause unrest.)

529
29:09.660 --> 29:10.180
Your Highness,

530
29:11.300 --> 29:12.500
never in history

531
29:12.780 --> 29:18.260
has a regent personally ventured into such danger.

532
29:18.780 --> 29:19.620
If there's no precedent,

533
29:20.460 --> 29:21.180
then I

534
29:21.860 --> 29:23.100
shall set one.

535
29:33.180 --> 29:34.820
You think I'm being reckless,

536
29:35.700 --> 29:36.060
don't you?

537
29:37.780 --> 29:39.260
You're all concerned about my safety,

538
29:39.740 --> 29:42.220
yet none of you seem concerned about the failed relief efforts

539
29:42.780 --> 29:43.660
and false reports across the empire.

540
29:44.860 --> 29:45.540
I had no idea

541
29:46.420 --> 29:47.700
that being Princess Regent

542
29:48.420 --> 29:49.700
meant living comfortably

543
29:50.780 --> 29:52.340
without taking the slightest risk.

544
29:54.780 --> 29:55.700
And remember this.

545
29:56.620 --> 29:57.140
From now on,

546
29:58.220 --> 29:59.820
anyone who cares only about personal safety

547
30:00.460 --> 30:01.620
and enjoying palace luxuries

548
30:02.580 --> 30:04.020
is unfit to govern the realm,

549
30:04.820 --> 30:06.100
much less bear responsibility for the nation!

550
30:10.220 --> 30:11.140
I am

551
30:12.180 --> 30:12.940
ashamed, Your Highness.

552
30:13.540 --> 30:15.340
We are ashamed, Your Highness!

553
30:26.260 --> 30:26.900
None of these will do!

554
30:27.060 --> 30:27.980
You there, come with me.

555
30:32.620 --> 30:33.260
Fang Tong?

556
30:37.780 --> 30:38.140
Your Highness.

557
30:39.220 --> 30:40.020
Why are you back?

558
30:41.140 --> 30:42.700
I heard you were going on a long journey,

559
30:42.980 --> 30:44.140
so of course I cut my leave short and came back.

560
30:44.420 --> 30:44.900
Don't be ridiculous!

561
30:46.500 --> 30:47.060
Go back home!

562
30:47.580 --> 30:48.300
I'm not going.

563
30:49.300 --> 30:50.500
Does Your Highness not want me around anymore?

564
30:50.820 --> 30:52.780
You're going so far away without taking me.

565
30:53.540 --> 30:55.060
Your wife only just gave birth.

566
30:58.460 --> 30:59.500
It's almost been a month.

567
31:00.100 --> 31:00.620
Besides,

568
31:01.020 --> 31:02.300
she urged me to come back too. She said...

569
31:02.300 --> 31:02.660
Enough!

570
31:03.940 --> 31:04.540
You're not coming.

571
31:05.180 --> 31:06.140
Get back home right now.

572
31:06.660 --> 31:07.100
I can't do that.

573
31:07.620 --> 31:08.220
I'd be too worried.

574
31:08.940 --> 31:09.860
You're traveling

575
31:10.180 --> 31:11.100
in disguise again,

576
31:11.340 --> 31:12.220
and it's dangerous out there.

577
31:12.700 --> 31:14.700
Who's going to protect you if I don't come?

578
31:15.620 --> 31:16.620
I've already chosen someone.

579
31:37.940 --> 31:38.740
Why are you zoning out?

580
31:39.380 --> 31:40.060
It's out of ink.

581
31:42.700 --> 31:43.340
I was counting.

582
31:44.820 --> 31:47.460
Over the past two months, across all the disaster-stricken prefectures,

583
31:48.500 --> 31:49.300
you've had one official executed,

584
31:50.100 --> 31:50.820
dismissed three others,

585
31:51.820 --> 31:53.580
and punished the corrupt officials who deserved it.

586
31:54.460 --> 31:55.500
The relief funds and grain

587
31:56.380 --> 31:57.860
have finally reached the people who need them.

588
31:58.980 --> 32:00.020
Now, on this final leg,

589
32:00.820 --> 32:02.140
I just hope we won't run into any more trouble.

590
32:03.540 --> 32:05.740
I have you to thank for protecting me so well, Yang Si.

591
32:06.420 --> 32:08.580
You haven't let anyone discover my identity.

592
32:15.860 --> 32:16.300
Wanyao,

593
32:17.220 --> 32:18.100
you've really changed a lot.

594
32:19.220 --> 32:20.700
So have you, Yang Si.

595
32:24.220 --> 32:24.940
These past two months,

596
32:25.500 --> 32:26.260
I've been bounced around until my bones ache.

597
32:26.900 --> 32:27.900
I'm completely exhausted.

598
32:28.940 --> 32:30.180
But I've actually enjoyed myself.

599
32:30.500 --> 32:32.820
More than being a carefree prince consort?

600
32:33.580 --> 32:34.780
Being a prince consort is fun too.

601
32:36.780 --> 32:38.020
Three years as Prince Consort,

602
32:38.780 --> 32:40.100
and I've nearly forgotten who I am.

603
32:41.460 --> 32:42.820
Sometimes I even feel

604
32:43.540 --> 32:45.020
like I'm a teenager again.

605
32:46.060 --> 32:47.420
All I have to think about is where to ride tomorrow,

606
32:47.980 --> 32:48.860
or where to watch cockfights.

607
32:49.700 --> 32:50.460
Nothing else to worry about.

608
32:53.940 --> 32:54.780
Being a teenager...

609
32:58.780 --> 32:59.660
Those days...

610
33:02.700 --> 33:03.580
I wouldn't want to go back.

611
33:21.020 --> 33:21.860
Easy now. Slowly!

612
33:21.980 --> 33:22.700
Come help us!

613
33:23.260 --> 33:23.780
Push!

614
33:23.780 --> 33:24.300
Push!

615
33:24.300 --> 33:24.940
Harder!

616
33:33.260 --> 33:34.060
Easy! Easy!

617
33:37.420 --> 33:38.100
What's going on?

618
33:39.060 --> 33:39.900
The carriage is stuck in a rut.

619
33:40.100 --> 33:40.380
Coming!

620
33:40.660 --> 33:41.420
There's room for one more here!

621
33:42.540 --> 33:44.900
One, two, three! Lift!

622
33:46.780 --> 33:47.260
Easy!

623
33:49.940 --> 33:50.740
Pull it back!

624
33:51.060 --> 33:51.860
Put some muscle into it!

625
33:51.860 --> 33:52.300
It won't budge!

626
33:52.300 --> 33:52.700
Further back!

627
33:52.820 --> 33:53.180
Push harder!

628
33:53.180 --> 33:54.020
The wheel's jammed!

629
33:56.980 --> 33:57.620
Give it some more effort!

630
33:59.460 --> 34:00.100
Where are we?

631
34:00.100 --> 34:01.020
You two, over there! Hurry!

632
34:01.420 --> 34:01.940
Lanyang.

633
34:02.180 --> 34:02.900
Put some rocks underneath.

634
34:03.220 --> 34:03.660
Where are the rocks?

635
34:04.100 --> 34:04.820
Coming! Here!

636
34:05.420 --> 34:06.700
(Lanyang, Hannan Circuit)

637
34:06.700 --> 34:07.260
From what I've seen along the way,

638
34:07.820 --> 34:08.460
this seems like a nice place.

639
34:09.180 --> 34:09.940
A little poor, perhaps,

640
34:11.380 --> 34:12.660
but the people seem honest and kind.

641
34:13.940 --> 34:14.780
Go sit over there for a while.

642
34:15.220 --> 34:15.860
We'll pull the carriage free.

643
34:16.540 --> 34:16.820
Hurry!

644
34:30.340 --> 34:30.940
(It can't be.)

645
34:32.500 --> 34:33.380
(It can't be that much of a coincidence.)

646
35:05.340 --> 35:06.060
If it's someone you know,

647
35:06.660 --> 35:07.300
why not go say hello?

648
35:35.540 --> 35:35.820
Water!

649
35:36.140 --> 35:36.940
Any water yet?

650
35:37.700 --> 35:38.260
Dig another half a chi!

651
35:38.700 --> 35:39.300
Almost there!

652
35:48.660 --> 35:50.380
(He's put down roots here.)

653
35:52.140 --> 35:52.940
(That's a good thing.)

654
35:54.740 --> 35:56.060
(We've both settled into our own lives.)

655
